Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["From a Sullivan Model to an IBL Algebra", "Title",
 CellID->509267359,ExpressionUUID->"4ddb5767-1f00-4973-a411-49eacd07850d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The dIBL algebra of a closed oriented ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "5149d7ca-03d3-4878-b9b6-c77bdeb7e04d"],
 "-manifold ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["X", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "511a12ea-69d2-43ad-9a51-e98c27488f36"],
 " lives on the cyclic words of a graded alphabet, and the alphabet is a \
basis of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["H", "TI"], "*"], "(", 
    StyleBox["X", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"9b973c60-7473-4a63-9932-c7b4182eb907"],
 " shifted by one, with the pairing that Poincar\[EAcute] duality gives it. \
This tutorial builds that alphabet without ever mentioning ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["X", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8f469ba1-006e-44ff-8c70-d46185ab79b0"],
 ": it starts from a Sullivan minimal model, puts the natural orientation on \
it, checks that the resulting oriented PDGA is of Hodge type, passes to the \
nondegenerate quotient, and reads the canonical Maurer-Cartan element off the \
triple product of the quotient. The running example is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["CP",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"84360919-a7e4-428b-b916-8c4d08f123d3"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"66560352-bbd3-4177-b6e9-9ebcd6d66ae1"],

Cell["Five steps, and each one is a single function.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4e148c84-ecce-4e82-9aa2-04cb45c7c3ea"],

Cell["The minimal model", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0673151e-271f-4632-9d75-d0c0fa362f48"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A Sullivan minimal model is a free graded commutative algebra ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalLambda]", 
    StyleBox["U", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "112a5b29-bfb6-4b25-bce8-6fcb0fd00509"],
 " with a differential. For ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["CP",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["m", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "9519dc41-193b-4ec0-aa5c-7632344e7bc5"],
 " it has two generators: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["a", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "331f9b57-804d-4ed0-b14b-40e632647db8"],
 " in degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["2", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3e6e16a8-e165-4c3a-87d1-57fe9f58b66c"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"f35f021c-8131-4599-a33b-9071920a3d0f"],
 ", and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "fe9cec45-9796-4541-bee7-11b149788d2a"],
 " in degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", 
    StyleBox["m", "TI"], "+", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"914dde3c-2548-48a1-b85f-83e8f7f9972c"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["m", "TI"], "+", "1"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"9eb655a6-3880-45f1-80c6-4cd0f42a4259"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7caf128e-20cf-4f54-ba18-071ceebc3639"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"model", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"SullivanModel", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<ComplexProjectiveSpace\>\"", "[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
  RowBox[{"model", "[", "\"\<Generators\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"9f650659-36f1-4395-934d-c373bf653869"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"a", "\[Rule]", "2"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"b", "\[Rule]", "5"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]= ",ExpressionUUID->"af74bfac-6f7a-469c-b83b-2c841352d99e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The differential is stored on the generators and extended as a derivation. It \
raises degree by one:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b4fd6432-c141-4b69-acc3-a71cd2ddaed9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelDifferential", "[", 
    RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelDifferential", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"a", " ", "b"}], ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"5f6be69c-2c05-4ce2-acc2-0e1380ef41c6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["a", "3"], ",", 
   SuperscriptBox["a", "4"]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"cf4c2294-edb7-489d-a48e-abb008b15a34"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A monomial is written as a product of generators, read in the order the \
model declares them. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SullivanModelBasis"]], 
    "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/SullivanModelBasis", "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "7493959f-b845-45e8-9fbc-5d427635ff9a"],
 " lists the monomials of one degree; the algebra is infinite-dimensional, \
one or two monomials in every degree from here up."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d341f7b4-59f0-492c-8fda-ff08185f193f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelBasis", "[", 
    RowBox[{"model", ",", " ", "k"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "8"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[3]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"3270296f-ef16-4271-840a-e352d4b29c80"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", "1", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", "a", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    SuperscriptBox["a", "2"], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", "b", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    SuperscriptBox["a", "3"], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"a", " ", "b"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    SuperscriptBox["a", "4"], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[3]= ",ExpressionUUID->"ee093a7f-9a2f-450b-b40d-fede3cda7238"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["The orientation, and the pairing it defines", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"00d4cc9e-6b24-45b7-88e4-41e8dbcabf6f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The cohomology of this model is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["R",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"[", 
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "]"}], "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], "3"], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"8e3feec4-c7ef-405d-ae2d-3f998d7a22af"],
 ", so the top class is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"a5cfc3ee-240a-4616-9a51-483ab69d3d8b"],
 " in degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "5cd18905-8eec-448e-9603-29a8cc691290"],
 ". Let the orientation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["O", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "fe879aad-6064-4166-85ed-a209dadefc58"],
 " be the coefficient of that monomial: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["1", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "143a1f46-077a-4509-a23b-90be1c2d45e9"],
 " on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"b2b4fe0a-4dd9-469f-bbb5-549403451863"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["0", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "327dd08d-bb9c-43dd-9cf2-5e61493ad676"],
 " on everything else. That is what ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"model", "[", "\"\<Orientation\>\"", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"2fdd0e3f-fb4c-4001-8fda-a2e7bcf9e747"],
 " records, as its values on the monomials of degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "762c91d9-d24c-4201-952f-1bde8ba0bfbf"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9450e1d4-9191-4f34-b145-9adc48208757"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"model", "[", "\"\<Orientation\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"model", "[", "\"\<Degree\>\"", "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[4]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"607c0e47-8145-4ebb-9a33-82c773a20a50"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["a", "2"], "\[Rule]", "1"}], "\[RightAssociation]"}], ",",
    "4"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[4]= ",ExpressionUUID->"14994dae-e0fb-4b81-adcc-9ec3fdfa8c61"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SullivanModelOrientation"]], 
    "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/SullivanModelOrientation", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "6c210d33-9e6a-44b4-93d8-48483b52a55d"],
 " applies it. Everything outside degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "4191a10a-4224-45ee-aca4-281fef37ae65"],
 " is killed, and inside degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "9af0ef33-0904-4bc1-82ec-b611e2eb2748"],
 " only ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"67fa9b4e-5994-448f-9a34-87d99e5c62d6"],
 " survives:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1fa73ecb-0600-47a5-8fcc-f80e54d72b89"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelOrientation", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"a", "^", "2"}], ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelOrientation", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"a", "^", "3"}], ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelOrientation", "[", 
    RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[5]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"3beb4018-c214-4f18-9545-a51074a31997"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"1", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[5]= ",ExpressionUUID->"863bd3fb-41c2-4f5c-b6a1-824e8e2c78d5"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The pairing is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "1"], ",", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "2"]}], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    
    StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "1"], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "2"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"8851364e-a328-4346-acde-c550f224bffd"],
 ", the orientation of the product. On ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", ",", 
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"c77d8ec1-fd61-4361-8918-dc5e192f56bd"],
 " it is the antidiagonal, which is Poincar\[EAcute] duality:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"922c3012-dbb4-4f36-a9f2-26c31c64b8a8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"SullivanModelPairing", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"a", "^", "i"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"a", "^", "j"}], ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", "//", 
  " ", "MatrixForm"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[6]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"29ab8317-8964-462b-a0d6-57ee5b271e6a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{
     {"0", "0", "1"},
     {"0", "1", "0"},
     {"1", "0", "0"}
    },
    GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {
        Offset[0.27999999999999997`], {
         Offset[0.7]}, 
        Offset[0.27999999999999997`]}, "Rows" -> {
        Offset[0.2], {
         Offset[0.4]}, 
        Offset[0.2]}}], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}],
  Function[BoxForm`e$, 
   MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[6]= ",ExpressionUUID->"6b8d1ba4-98be-43db-9948-3bdfd220b706"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This is an ",
 StyleBox["orientation", "TI"],
 " in the sense of Lambrechts-Stanley: it has degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8ba77add-8e0c-4fc0-a2c4-e721c33ab67a"],
 ", it kills the image of the differential, and it does not vanish on the \
kernel. Together with the perfect pairing it induces on cohomology, that \
makes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"\[CapitalLambda]", 
     StyleBox["U", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["d",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", 
     StyleBox["O", "TI"]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"1e10e395-424d-407c-ad4a-22d7567ce4f1"],
 " an oriented PDGA of degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "0176f845-b6d6-405b-b91e-984bb78221a0"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"310b7922-f9b3-454c-b1a8-849fa2b69dbb"],

Cell["Is it of Hodge type?", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f344a8ae-f34d-4b78-a5cd-1bbd6af67d01"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The pairing is ",
 StyleBox["not", "TI"],
 " perfect on chain level: the whole of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalLambda]", 
    StyleBox["U", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "b3642a31-cbce-4c3e-b57d-50c52c3bace9"],
 " above degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "9e1d870c-15da-413b-ab25-72cf9e59690e"],
 " is paired to zero with everything, because the orientation only sees \
degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "9d0e56e1-78a6-45d0-b93f-acf7fac17526"],
 ". Those elements form the ",
 StyleBox["degenerate subspace", "TI"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["deg",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "357f275f-aac5-448a-86b0-a991b025c214"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4ee50585-8c46-41a2-880c-ab2c23b6eb34"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"DegenerateSubspace", "[", 
    RowBox[{"model", ",", " ", "5"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"DegenerateSubspace", "[", 
    RowBox[{"model", ",", " ", "6"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"DegenerateSubspace", "[", 
    RowBox[{"model", ",", " ", "7"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[7]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"626b97ed-04ba-4d2d-b0bf-b807e42659e3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", "b", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    SuperscriptBox["a", "3"], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"a", " ", "b"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[7]= ",ExpressionUUID->"2f0a2657-893f-426d-bd9c-ba62d6fb8447"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The oriented PDGA is ",
 StyleBox["of Hodge type", "TI"],
 " when it admits a Hodge decomposition ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["H", "TI"], "\[CirclePlus]", 
    StyleBox["im",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], " ", 
    StyleBox["d",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[CirclePlus]", 
    StyleBox["C", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8d0ef929-cfc1-46fa-bf02-f8e9522ef396"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["C", "TI"], "\[Perpendicular]", 
    StyleBox["C", "TI"], "\[CirclePlus]", 
    StyleBox["H", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "9a4ba78a-319a-49fc-8485-b630b566c659"],
 ". Over a field of characteristic ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[NotEqual]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"57fc6eec-add4-4a06-8103-ecb7ae9da466"],
 " and for a quotient of finite type, that happens exactly when ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["deg",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "70774bb5-adcb-4cb2-8f69-00ab9e196b3f"],
 " is acyclic, equivalently exactly when the quotient map onto the \
nondegenerate quotient is a quasi-isomorphism. So the test is one cohomology \
computation."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"72f30b5c-d5aa-4c22-86bd-ce871256a445"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"HodgeTypeQ", "[", "model", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[8]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"9a9d29b1-114b-4493-8458-93fa1d1d85cb"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[8]= ",ExpressionUUID->"f1cee1da-ac2b-4004-b559-f650772925fc"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["HodgeTypeReport"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/HodgeTypeReport", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "7ad3cf01-4685-41af-9c48-849321998378"],
 " shows why, degree by degree. The fourth column is the cohomology of the \
degenerate subspace, and it vanishes throughout. Here the second and fifth \
columns agree as well, which says more: the quotient carries no differential, \
so it ",
 StyleBox["is", "TI"],
 " the cohomology: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["CP",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"6d2ce963-fbf2-4ae4-8e74-79728292c20a"],
 " is formal. A Hodge-type model whose quotient keeps a differential has ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "Cohomology"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "0bd28a32-1992-4d6c-82f2-ff288b9c429b"],
 " strictly below ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "Quotient"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "19b5be12-fed3-4946-b249-245fc9fed2e1"],
 ", and the next tutorial shows one."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"386ecb58-af6e-4c8b-9be8-0dfc2c4f7d2d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"HodgeTypeReport", "[", "model", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[9]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"679ab863-dc37-4d7a-be15-ab2e9fca1ebd"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  TagBox[
